alue of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle saw April to May at 178% and May to June at 183%, then November to December at just 41%. So far in 2026 February to March sits at 62% on the middle. All 4 grids had their driest year in 2007, with grid 17581 at 55%.</p>"}
